 outcomes are satisfied. Minor leftover temp files from the test-listener and reboot commands are a small hygiene ding but not a functional issue.","limitations":["The executor's attempted live external-traffic test of the reject behavior was inconclusive/invalid due to same-host loopback routing (self-directed traffic bypasses the zone), so 'reject' behavior is confirmed via static nft ruleset inspection rather than an actual blocked-connection observation from a genuinely external client.","Minor temp-file residue (http8080/9999 log+pid files, reboot.log) was left on node1 after the executor's verification and restart steps."]},"ttft_ms":20700,"type":"result","duration_ms":52084,"uuid":"ae037d7a-f1ad-42a4-928e-6fbc9c9384d7","ttft_stream_ms":859,"time_to_request_ms":194,"first_content_frame_ms":860,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
